@host = http://localhost:5104

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Open an account (copy the "id" from the response into @ahmet / @ayse below)
POST {{host}}/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "currency": "TRY" }

###
@ahmet = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@ayse = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Pay in 100 TL
POST {{host}}/accounts/{{ahmet}}/deposits
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 100.00, "currency": "TRY" }

### Balance
GET {{host}}/accounts/{{ahmet}}

### Transfer 30 TL (copy the "id" from the response, or "transferId" from a 422, into @transfer below)
POST {{host}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sourceAccountId": "{{ahmet}}", "destinationAccountId": "{{ayse}}", "amount": 30.00, "currency": "TRY" }

###
@transfer = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Transfer status
GET {{host}}/transfers/{{transfer}}
